       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-DQS-TO-DAI.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DQS-TO-DAI-PROOFS.
           05  WS-EMBODIMENT-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REACTION-RECIPROCITY-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STRESS-5000-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DAI-LATENCY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DQS-DAI-SEAL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DQS-TO-DAI-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-DAI-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-DAI-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-EMBODIMENT-AND-RECIPROCITY.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-STRESS-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-DAI-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-EMBODIMENT-AND-RECIPROCITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EMBODIMENT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REACTION-RECIPROCITY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-STRESS-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STRESS-5000-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DAI-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-DAI-PROOFS.
           IF WS-EMBODIMENT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-REACTION-RECIPROCITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STRESS-5000-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DAI-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DQS-DAI-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-DAI-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-DAI-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-DAI-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-DAI-CODE.
